  "title": "Turkey Tenderloins",
  "description": "Turkey tenderloins are marinated in a simple mixture of soy, Dijon, and rosemary, then cooked under the broiler. Nice alternative to cooking a whole bird!",
  "authors": [
    "Christine L"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-06-01T20:41:24-04:00",
