  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "3 tablespoons soy sauce",
    "1 tablespoon Dijon-style prepared mustard",
    "2 teaspoons dried rosemary, crushed",
    "1 pound turkey tenderloins"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rVP9UesSIXAca8v3JU_vrLLJLgI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-0-157-af2a60ac822e411189db0d762cd98fd8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk soy, Dijon, and rosemary together in a bowl. Place tenderloins into a resealable plastic bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KCaUtVDUvM1OmfFN1ud_XIIT5D4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-2-161-1f81bd78e3ff4c75888c35e67b898769.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour marinade into the resealable plastic bag with tenderloins. Coat tenderloins with marinade, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate in the refrigerator for 1 to 4 hours, shaking once or twice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MafolyCnqOSphaOrdH3K_t0bNNg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-3-162-6b78536b39a2463d8c64c31774bc5eeb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When ready to cook, set an oven rack about 4 inches from the heat source and preheat the oven's broiler.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove tenderloins from marinade and shake off excess; place onto a rack in a broiler pan. Discard remaining marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/87UMA5rx6TnN2qsYmBTJZnbZq6s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-4-237-2c98c722f5c54b089ab0a5044a6331db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broil tenderloins in the preheated oven for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6bMWlFL7kgrF82aceEfrqzKgyp0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-5-A-284-5b27c43bb4214a50aa1d7ed0dc15a6a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip tenderloins and continue to broil until no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 10 to 12 more minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rmk2ztZBEVcYeJvDiHke6T9Tp38=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-5-B-287-88ed451dcdb9442f9fa9e0412b2ac413.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice tenderloins and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZL7zVsFVB1x8ic-3Sw2_7ZZG_hg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9231-Turkey-Tenderloins-ddmfs-step-6-290-716e7380fdbc480d8087dfb800ebc414.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9231/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
